><p>A downloadable Games for Windows</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong>Heart of Empty</strong>: An atmospheric retro first-person shooter that takes you to an alternative history of the <strong>USSR</strong> during the<strong> late 1950&#x27;s.</strong> In this dark and gloomy world where post-war recovery has turned into a nightmare, players find themselves at the heart of events that change their perception of reality.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>The plot of the game is tells of fails experiment, as a result of which the city in which the tests took place becomes a dead zone. You are one of the survivors who somehow managed to escape the effects of the mutation and you must explore the ruins, as well as find out how this tragedy could have happened.</p>\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong>\r\n</p>\r\n<ul><li><strong>10 atmospheric stages:</strong> from abandoned warehouses to secret locations concealing the dark secrets of Soviet history. Each stage immerses players in a unique horror and despair atmosphere.\r\n</li><li><strong>A diverse arsenal:</strong> from classic Mauser rifles and PPSh submachine guns to futuristic firearms that aid survival in this altered reality.\r\n</li><li><strong>Over 16 mutant types: </strong>once ordinary citizens transformed into nightmarish beings driven by bloodlust. Each mutant possesses unique weaknesses and strategies, requiring players to be resourceful.\r\n</li><li><strong>Unique health regeneration mechanics:</strong> medkits aren&#x27;t the only means of survival. Players can also recover health through vending machines selling carbonated water, which provides strength and endurance.\r\n</li><li><strong>Two endings:</strong> players&#x27; final choices determine the fate of the protagonist and the outcome.\r\n</li><li><strong>Survival among fellow survivors: </strong>in this dark realm, players aren&#x27;t alone. They encounter other individuals who escaped mutation and can provide insights into the catastrophic event. \r\n</li><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMzc3OTg4LnBuZw==/original/OXHBdt.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" width=\"12\" height=\"6\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\" id=\"game_info_panel_9775782\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 16:24 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 2 hours ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://vzs93.itch.io\">VZS Productions</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-shooter\">Shooter</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-action\">Actio